  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educate the Girls-Educate the Nation-Balochistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education is one of the fundamental rights of citizens secured by any state. The  state guarantees this right through the  Article 25A of constitution which states;  &quot;The State shall provide free and compulsory education to all children of the age of five to sixteen years in such manner as may be determined by law.&quot; But, the education for Girls and Boys is very less. Through this project we will provide resources for girls ages 4-20 to get their education in the Province of Balochistan.</narrative>
  </description>
